> ring GF(2)[x]/(x^4 + 1)
GF(2)[x]/(x^4 + 1)
  16 elements (2^4), characteristic 2, dimension 4 over GF(2)
  a field: no; an integral domain: no: the modulus factors, x^4 + 1 = (x + 1)^4
  units: 8 (by CRT over the factors: q^(d e) - q^(d (e-1)) for each factor of degree d to the power e); zero divisors: 7 nonzero
  e.g. (x + 1) * (x^3 + x^2 + x + 1) = 0
