> is 0x03 a generator of GF(2^8) aes
  ucas: primroot 0x03 in gf(2^8) aes
  note: integers are elements in integer notation (the coefficients as base-2 digits): 0x03 = x + 1
yes: 0x03 is a generator of GF(2^8, aes)* (order 255 of 255)
